### List all documents
GET {{apiUrl}}/documents

### Get specific document
GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/getting-started

### Create new document
POST {{apiUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metaData": {
    "title": "Getting Started",
    "tags": ["guide", "introduction"]
  },
  "content": "# Getting Started\n\nWelcome to Schist! This is your first wiki document.\n\n## What is Schist?\n\nSchist is a lightweight, self-hosted markdown wiki.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Create more documents\n2. Link documents together with [[Document Links]]\n3. Organize your knowledge\n\nHappy writing! 📝"
}

### Update existing document
PUT {{apiUrl}}/documents/getting-started
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metaData": {
    "title": "Getting Started - Updated",
    "tags": ["guide", "introduction", "updated"]
  },
  "content": "# Getting Started - Updated\n\nWelcome to Schist! This document has been updated.\n\n## Features\n\n- Markdown editing\n- Wiki-style linking\n- Full-text search\n- File-based storage\n\n## Links\n\nCheck out [[Project Ideas]] for inspiration."
}

### Delete document
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/documents/getting-started